.TH CHTTPCLI_CONSTRUCT 3 "2026-07-10" "c_collections" "C Collections Library - Macros"
.SH NAME
chttpcli_construct \- declare and initialise a chttpcli handle
.SH LIBRARY
C Collections (libccollections, \-lccollections)
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
#include <chttpclient.h>

chttpcli_construct(name)
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
.nf
Declares a chttpcli variable named name and immediately calls
create_chttpclient to initialise it.  On failure, calls fatal_err()
and does not return.
.fi
.SH PARAMETERS
.nf
name     Identifier for the new handle variable.
.fi
.SH "SEE ALSO"
.BR chttpcli_construct_scoped (3),
.BR chttpcli_declare (3),
.BR create_chttpclient (3)
